1
00:00:15,390 --> 00:00:17,058
[Chinatsu] Sorry, Nagisa.

2
00:00:17,642 --> 00:00:19,893
There's actually something
I need to take care of.

3
00:00:19,894 --> 00:00:22,313
Uh, whatever you say.

4
00:00:25,650 --> 00:00:30,321
{\an8}EIMEI PRIVATE HIGH SCHOOL

5
00:00:37,954 --> 00:00:38,955
[Taiki chuckles softly]

6
00:00:42,917 --> 00:00:44,836
- [Christmas tree rustling]
- [ornaments rattling]

7
00:00:53,178 --> 00:00:55,096
DECORATIONS

8
00:00:55,930 --> 00:00:59,559
{\an8}[Taiki humming
"We Wish You a Merry Christmas"]

9
00:01:16,201 --> 00:01:19,203
[door sliding open]

10
00:01:19,204 --> 00:01:20,622
[stops humming, gasps]

11
00:01:25,085 --> 00:01:26,086
[exclaims]

12
00:01:26,711 --> 00:01:28,712
[hesitates] You scared me!

13
00:01:28,713 --> 00:01:30,589
Don't sneak up on me like that.

14
00:01:30,590 --> 00:01:33,467
- Sorry.
- [Taiki] I thought you were a ghost.

15
00:01:33,468 --> 00:01:36,094
Uh, wouldn't Santa be more appropriate?

16
00:01:36,095 --> 00:01:37,514
Uh...

17
00:01:47,607 --> 00:01:50,317
- Hang on, why are you here right now?
- [door slides shut]

18
00:01:50,318 --> 00:01:51,528
What about the game?

19
00:01:52,320 --> 00:01:53,529
[Chinatsu] Mmm.

20
00:01:53,530 --> 00:01:55,364
We won the first round, actually.

21
00:01:55,365 --> 00:01:56,740
[gasps]

22
00:01:56,741 --> 00:01:58,284
Congratulations.

23
00:01:59,119 --> 00:02:00,369
Thanks so much.

24
00:02:00,370 --> 00:02:03,289
Also, I heard about the ticket.

25
00:02:03,873 --> 00:02:04,874
Mmm.

26
00:02:05,875 --> 00:02:07,293
Because of what you did,

27
00:02:07,919 --> 00:02:10,296
- Yumeka and I made up.
- [gasps softly]

28
00:02:11,756 --> 00:02:13,382
[gentle music building]

29
00:02:13,383 --> 00:02:15,884
Good thing you won the ticket.

30
00:02:15,885 --> 00:02:18,262
I heard that
you had to run a lot to get it.

31
00:02:18,263 --> 00:02:19,388
[Taiki] Huh?

32
00:02:19,389 --> 00:02:21,390
Uh, no, not at all!

33
00:02:21,391 --> 00:02:23,643
It was just a little light jog.

34
00:02:26,396 --> 00:02:29,691
[Chinatsu] You know, I'd always noticed
something was up with Yumeka.

35
00:02:30,775 --> 00:02:33,486
<i>I felt something in her life
was bothering her.</i>

36
00:02:34,779 --> 00:02:38,282
And yet, I didn't try
to talk to her about it.

37
00:02:38,283 --> 00:02:40,617
And she never brought it up.

38
00:02:40,618 --> 00:02:41,619
[gasps]

39
00:02:43,288 --> 00:02:45,290
[gentle music playing]

40
00:02:56,467 --> 00:02:58,970
I had been regretting that so much.

41
00:02:59,554 --> 00:03:01,221
But today, when we talked,

42
00:03:01,222 --> 00:03:04,100
I was able to come to terms
with that feeling.

43
00:03:05,310 --> 00:03:07,729
Taiki, when I heard what you did,

44
00:03:08,396 --> 00:03:09,689
all I wanted...

45
00:03:14,110 --> 00:03:16,738
was to come here to thank you.

46
00:03:17,989 --> 00:03:18,990
[gasps softly]

47
00:03:20,491 --> 00:03:21,826
Oh, gotcha.

48
00:03:22,785 --> 00:03:24,120
Well, it was nothing.

49
00:03:29,375 --> 00:03:34,297
After learning Yumeka influenced you
and had such a big impact on your life,

50
00:03:35,423 --> 00:03:38,843
it made me think of all the ways
that you influenced me.

51
00:03:40,220 --> 00:03:42,430
This was my way of returning the favor.

52
00:03:45,016 --> 00:03:46,559
[gasps softly]

53
00:03:49,771 --> 00:03:52,690
[music continues playing]

54
00:03:56,778 --> 00:03:58,196
[Christmas tree rustling]

55
00:04:00,782 --> 00:04:02,617
[ornaments rattling]

56
00:04:05,286 --> 00:04:08,873
[humming "We Wish You a Merry Christmas"]

57
00:04:21,052 --> 00:04:22,928
- [Taiki stops humming]
- [gentle music stops]

58
00:04:22,929 --> 00:04:24,180
Oh.

59
00:04:24,764 --> 00:04:26,140
[gasps]

60
00:04:35,984 --> 00:04:37,151
Thanks for grabbing that.

61
00:04:43,658 --> 00:04:45,660
[soft romantic music playing]

62
00:04:49,372 --> 00:04:50,373
Hmm?

63
00:05:02,927 --> 00:05:03,928
Huh?

64
00:05:07,181 --> 00:05:08,182
Sorry.

65
00:05:14,689 --> 00:05:15,940
Let me hug you.

66
00:05:17,317 --> 00:05:18,735
Just for a little bit.

67
00:05:20,528 --> 00:05:22,530
[music continues playing]

68
00:05:51,934 --> 00:05:53,936
[music fades]

69
00:05:54,604 --> 00:05:56,606
[opening theme music playing]

70
00:05:57,482 --> 00:06:01,736
BLUE BOX SEASON 2

71
00:07:24,485 --> 00:07:28,697
EPISODE 31
CHRISTMAS EVE

72
00:07:28,698 --> 00:07:30,408
[exhales deeply]

73
00:07:33,619 --> 00:07:35,621
[soft music playing]

74
00:07:45,423 --> 00:07:46,924
[grunts nervously]

75
00:08:23,503 --> 00:08:24,587
[Chinatsu] Thank you.

76
00:08:29,175 --> 00:08:30,343
Of course.

77
00:08:33,304 --> 00:08:34,305
[heart thumping]

78
00:08:44,524 --> 00:08:47,567
[Taiki] Um... Chinatsu, I...

79
00:08:47,568 --> 00:08:48,986
[gasps softly]

80
00:08:50,071 --> 00:08:52,073
[music fades]

81
00:08:53,491 --> 00:08:54,992
We should get going.

82
00:08:56,536 --> 00:08:57,995
Uh...

83
00:09:03,334 --> 00:09:04,502
[student] Hi, Chinatsu.

84
00:09:10,591 --> 00:09:11,884
[groans]

85
00:09:12,843 --> 00:09:15,596
[hesitates] <i>What just happened?</i>

86
00:09:17,598 --> 00:09:19,559
<i>A hug. A hug?</i>

87
00:09:20,977 --> 00:09:24,021
<i>My shoulder still feels warm.</i>

88
00:09:26,983 --> 00:09:28,985
[gentle music playing]

89
00:09:30,486 --> 00:09:33,280
<i>Maybe she was worried
about the second round tomorrow</i>

90
00:09:33,281 --> 00:09:34,907
<i>and wanted someone to lean on.</i>

91
00:09:35,992 --> 00:09:37,450
<i>Or maybe...</i>

92
00:09:37,451 --> 00:09:41,789
<i>she was feeling emotional
after making up with Yumeka.</i>

93
00:09:43,124 --> 00:09:44,874
<i>- Or maybe...</i>
- [faint laughter]

94
00:09:44,875 --> 00:09:47,043
- Uh?
- [indistinct chatter]

95
00:09:47,044 --> 00:09:49,796
[Nishida] Hey, Taiki! Come join us!

96
00:09:49,797 --> 00:09:51,799
[gentle music continues playing]

97
00:09:56,929 --> 00:09:58,097
<i>Could it be...</i>

98
00:10:12,820 --> 00:10:14,904
[music fades]

99
00:10:14,905 --> 00:10:16,907
[birds chirping]

100
00:10:25,583 --> 00:10:26,584
[grunts softly]

101
00:10:27,335 --> 00:10:28,418
[gasps]

102
00:10:28,419 --> 00:10:29,420
[exclaims]

103
00:10:32,923 --> 00:10:33,924
Uh...

104
00:10:34,425 --> 00:10:35,675
[Taiki panting]

105
00:10:35,676 --> 00:10:37,595
Mom! Where's Chinatsu?

106
00:10:38,262 --> 00:10:40,097
She had to leave a while ago.

107
00:10:41,015 --> 00:10:43,184
She said the second round starts at 1:00.

108
00:10:43,893 --> 00:10:45,102
I see.

109
00:10:45,686 --> 00:10:47,812
[Yukiko]
Don't you have practice in the afternoon?

110
00:10:47,813 --> 00:10:49,564
Hurry up and get ready.

111
00:10:49,565 --> 00:10:50,940
[Taiki] Okay.

112
00:10:50,941 --> 00:10:52,943
[footsteps approaching]

113
00:11:04,080 --> 00:11:07,040
- What's got you so spaced out?
- Oh! Uh, it's nothing!

114
00:11:07,041 --> 00:11:08,083
- Bye!
- [Kyo] Hmm?

115
00:11:08,084 --> 00:11:10,169
[Taiki]
I'm going to the club room for a bit!

116
00:11:11,837 --> 00:11:12,838
Hmm.

117
00:11:14,215 --> 00:11:15,508
[pants]

118
00:11:18,177 --> 00:11:21,055
<i>I can't stop thinking about
what happened yesterday.</i>

119
00:11:21,931 --> 00:11:23,933
[soft romantic music playing]

120
00:11:25,226 --> 00:11:26,267
<i>And the truth is,</i>

121
00:11:26,268 --> 00:11:29,897
<i>I wanted to ask Chinatsu more
about Yumeka and how they made up.</i>

122
00:11:30,981 --> 00:11:33,901
<i>I wonder if Yumeka
will start playing basketball again.</i>

123
00:11:35,486 --> 00:11:39,115
<i>If she does, I'm sure
Chinatsu would be happy about it.</i>

124
00:11:40,449 --> 00:11:42,993
<i>So happy that maybe she'd...</i>

125
00:11:43,494 --> 00:11:45,120
[music swells, stops]

126
00:11:45,121 --> 00:11:47,664
<i>There I go thinking about it again!</i>

127
00:11:47,665 --> 00:11:49,124
[groaning frustratedly]

128
00:11:49,125 --> 00:11:51,544
Did you get
another toothache or something?

129
00:11:52,253 --> 00:11:53,545
Uh...

130
00:11:53,546 --> 00:11:54,547
[gasps]

131
00:12:03,013 --> 00:12:04,347
[Taiki] Yumeka.

132
00:12:04,348 --> 00:12:05,474
Your hair...

133
00:12:07,351 --> 00:12:10,187
[Yumeka] It is cold
to have short hair in the winter.

134
00:12:12,064 --> 00:12:14,274
But it doesn't get in the way
playing basketball.

135
00:12:14,275 --> 00:12:15,276
[gasps]

136
00:12:18,112 --> 00:12:19,988
[Yumeka] I have a free period.

137
00:12:19,989 --> 00:12:23,200
I was thinking of joining
my high school's basketball team.

138
00:12:24,243 --> 00:12:25,827
So you're playing again?

139
00:12:25,828 --> 00:12:28,913
Now that I'm trying
to catch up with Chinatsu,

140
00:12:28,914 --> 00:12:30,582
I'll have to put in the effort.

141
00:12:30,583 --> 00:12:32,083
[gasps]

142
00:12:32,084 --> 00:12:33,251
[Yumeka chuckling wickedly]

143
00:12:33,252 --> 00:12:35,671
[Taiki] <i>Have I just created
a terrible rivalry?</i>

144
00:12:36,839 --> 00:12:37,922
[Yumeka] Remember,

145
00:12:37,923 --> 00:12:41,009
you gotta make sure to keep
supporting Natsu as much as you can.

146
00:12:41,010 --> 00:12:42,761
She can't lose time like I did.

147
00:12:43,471 --> 00:12:45,264
You're her boyfriend, after all.

148
00:12:47,183 --> 00:12:48,642
Mmm. [breath trembles]

149
00:12:49,351 --> 00:12:52,353
- She and I aren't dating!
- [gasps] Huh?

150
00:12:52,354 --> 00:12:55,857
[Taiki] Actually, that was all
just your misunderstanding!

151
00:12:55,858 --> 00:12:58,777
Natsu finally got herself a boyfriend.

152
00:12:59,361 --> 00:13:01,989
[Taiki] <i>Thinking back,
I never actually corrected her.</i>

153
00:13:02,823 --> 00:13:03,866
Huh?

154
00:13:05,075 --> 00:13:06,451
Lemme get this straight.

155
00:13:06,452 --> 00:13:07,952
You aren't Natsu's boyfriend,

156
00:13:07,953 --> 00:13:11,331
yet you felt the need to butt in so much
that you exhausted yourself

157
00:13:11,332 --> 00:13:12,749
just to get me a ticket?

158
00:13:12,750 --> 00:13:14,502
[hesitates] I'm so sorry.

159
00:13:15,085 --> 00:13:17,338
You do have feelings
for Natsu though, right?

160
00:13:18,881 --> 00:13:19,882
Well, I...

161
00:13:20,841 --> 00:13:24,135
- [Yumeka] Don't tell me you got rejected?
- [Taiki] No.

162
00:13:24,136 --> 00:13:26,013
I haven't told her yet.

163
00:13:26,597 --> 00:13:28,766
You're a real chicken burger, aren't you?

164
00:13:30,643 --> 00:13:32,269
Why a burger?

165
00:13:33,062 --> 00:13:36,273
Man, Natsu can be real hard
to read sometimes.

166
00:13:36,857 --> 00:13:39,652
I thought she wasn't interested
in romance or dating.

167
00:13:40,236 --> 00:13:42,071
Yeah, that's what I thought too.

168
00:13:43,405 --> 00:13:46,408
- [Yumeka] What are you making excuses for?
- Huh?

169
00:13:46,992 --> 00:13:47,993
[chuckles softly]

170
00:13:51,121 --> 00:13:52,414
Uh...

171
00:13:53,707 --> 00:13:56,210
[Yumeka]
<i>Love is the strongest feeling there is.</i>

172
00:13:59,129 --> 00:14:01,215
{\an8}[Taiki] <i>The next day, in the third round,</i>

173
00:14:02,341 --> 00:14:04,343
{\an8}<i>Chinatsu and her team lost.</i>

174
00:14:05,261 --> 00:14:08,472
{\an8}<i>Their opponent would go on
to win the tournament.</i>

175
00:14:09,765 --> 00:14:12,017
<i>They were frustrated
with how it turned out,</i>

176
00:14:12,685 --> 00:14:16,021
<i>but they also felt proud
that they did better than last time.</i>

177
00:14:17,273 --> 00:14:21,277
<i>And still I'm asking myself,
"What was the meaning of that hug?"</i>

178
00:14:22,903 --> 00:14:24,029
<i>I couldn't ask her.</i>

179
00:14:24,530 --> 00:14:26,156
<i>I never got the chance.</i>

180
00:14:34,707 --> 00:14:36,709
[birds chirping]

181
00:14:41,297 --> 00:14:44,258
[Yukiko] Your parents' flight
will arrive at 8:00 p.m., right?

182
00:14:44,758 --> 00:14:48,136
Right. So I'm leaving by 6:00
at the latest to pick them up.

183
00:14:48,137 --> 00:14:51,432
Then from there, you'll be heading
to your grandpa's house in Nagano.

184
00:14:52,057 --> 00:14:53,934
From tomorrow until the New Year.

185
00:14:54,518 --> 00:14:57,604
That means it'll be a bit
of a lonely New Year's Eve for us.

186
00:14:57,605 --> 00:14:58,771
[Taiki] Morning.

187
00:14:58,772 --> 00:15:01,399
[Yukiko] What's with that gnarly bedhead?

188
00:15:01,400 --> 00:15:02,859
Shape up and face the day!

189
00:15:02,860 --> 00:15:04,945
- [groans] Huh?
- [toast crunches]

190
00:15:07,656 --> 00:15:08,657
Uh...

191
00:15:10,242 --> 00:15:11,659
[gasps softly]

192
00:15:11,660 --> 00:15:13,787
Uh, I'm gonna go wash my hair!

193
00:15:14,538 --> 00:15:16,582
If you wash it too much, you'll go bald.

194
00:15:18,000 --> 00:15:19,001
Mmm.

195
00:15:21,587 --> 00:15:22,670
[water running]

196
00:15:22,671 --> 00:15:24,672
[groans]

197
00:15:24,673 --> 00:15:26,592
<i>How am I supposed to act around her?</i>

198
00:15:27,176 --> 00:15:30,137
<i>I can't talk to her at home
because my mom's here.</i>

199
00:15:31,430 --> 00:15:32,597
[gasps]

200
00:15:32,598 --> 00:15:35,351
[breathing heavily]

201
00:15:36,226 --> 00:15:37,728
<i>I'm running out of time.</i>

202
00:15:42,942 --> 00:15:45,276
[teacher] It's time for year-end cleaning!

203
00:15:45,277 --> 00:15:47,737
And make sure everything's spotless!

204
00:15:47,738 --> 00:15:49,573
[students] Okay.

205
00:15:51,408 --> 00:15:52,575
Taiki.

206
00:15:52,576 --> 00:15:55,536
That side is done,
see if they need help anywhere else.

207
00:15:55,537 --> 00:15:56,956
Roger that.

208
00:16:04,546 --> 00:16:06,339
[Taiki] <i>Look at her.</i>

209
00:16:06,340 --> 00:16:07,967
<i>She's acting so normal.</i>

210
00:16:08,884 --> 00:16:11,220
<i>Makes me think it was all a dream.</i>

211
00:16:16,058 --> 00:16:18,893
Can't we just leave
the Christmas tree up all year?

212
00:16:18,894 --> 00:16:19,936
[student] What?

213
00:16:19,937 --> 00:16:21,230
- [Ayame] Hey, over there!
- [all gasp]

214
00:16:22,356 --> 00:16:24,065
Don't wipe in circles!

215
00:16:24,066 --> 00:16:26,567
- Only vertical and horizontal movements!
- [male students whimper]

216
00:16:26,568 --> 00:16:29,320
And don't forget to dust in the corners!

217
00:16:29,321 --> 00:16:32,241
{\an8}[sternly]
I'd better not see one speck of dirt!

218
00:16:32,825 --> 00:16:35,034
{\an8}- This girl is the toughest manager ever.
- [Ayame mumbling]

219
00:16:35,035 --> 00:16:36,995
{\an8}At first, I just thought
she was being cute.

220
00:16:36,996 --> 00:16:39,080
{\an8}But she's actually
even stricter than my mom.

221
00:16:39,081 --> 00:16:42,083
- Inota, why are you standing around?
- Well...

222
00:16:42,084 --> 00:16:44,127
If you're all done with your work,

223
00:16:44,128 --> 00:16:46,337
go and see what supplies we have left.

224
00:16:46,338 --> 00:16:48,340
[indistinct chatter]

225
00:16:51,343 --> 00:16:53,970
[Taiki] <i>I can't believe
this is where we were on Christmas Eve</i>

226
00:16:53,971 --> 00:16:55,264
<i>when it all happened.</i>

227
00:16:56,515 --> 00:16:58,392
<i>Maybe it was a dream, after all.</i>

228
00:17:01,854 --> 00:17:03,022
Oh, good sir.

229
00:17:03,856 --> 00:17:07,151
- Well done.
- Oh. Sure, happy to help.

230
00:17:08,152 --> 00:17:10,279
Looks like we have everything
we need for now.

231
00:17:10,904 --> 00:17:12,488
Yeah, I guess so.

232
00:17:12,489 --> 00:17:13,490
[Nagisa] Cool.

233
00:17:14,616 --> 00:17:16,034
[Taiki] <i>See that?</i>

234
00:17:16,035 --> 00:17:18,328
<i>Chinatsu's the same as always.</i>

235
00:17:18,996 --> 00:17:20,955
<i>As if the hug never happened.</i>

236
00:17:20,956 --> 00:17:22,040
[cart rustles]

237
00:17:22,041 --> 00:17:23,541
Excuse me, coming through.

238
00:17:23,542 --> 00:17:24,543
[Taiki gasps]

239
00:17:35,012 --> 00:17:36,472
Oh, sorry.

240
00:17:38,015 --> 00:17:39,933
Don't worry, it's fine.

241
00:17:40,601 --> 00:17:41,935
I'll be more careful.

242
00:17:44,563 --> 00:17:47,398
I'll go and submit this.
You finish organizing.

243
00:17:47,399 --> 00:17:48,400
[Chinatsu] Sure.

244
00:18:00,621 --> 00:18:03,081
That thing from the other day...

245
00:18:03,082 --> 00:18:04,249
Huh?

246
00:18:06,001 --> 00:18:07,336
Did you not like it?

247
00:18:14,343 --> 00:18:16,261
[Taiki] <i>Not like it?</i>

248
00:18:16,845 --> 00:18:18,764
<i>No, actually...</i>

249
00:18:20,265 --> 00:18:21,349
No, I--

250
00:18:21,350 --> 00:18:22,850
[Nishida] Hey!

251
00:18:22,851 --> 00:18:25,562
They're giving us soft drinks as a treat.

252
00:18:26,355 --> 00:18:28,357
[gentle music playing]

253
00:18:29,858 --> 00:18:32,778
[Nishida humming joyfully]

254
00:18:34,363 --> 00:18:35,781
[Taiki] <i>She's got it wrong!</i>

255
00:18:37,199 --> 00:18:38,367
<i>It's not like that.</i>

256
00:18:39,868 --> 00:18:41,328
<i>It's not like that at all!</i>

257
00:18:45,374 --> 00:18:46,624
Mmm.

258
00:18:46,625 --> 00:18:47,543
[Ayame] Hmm?

259
00:18:50,879 --> 00:18:52,213
Hey, uh, Chono.

260
00:18:52,214 --> 00:18:54,006
- Can you help me carry this thing?
- [Hina] Hmm?

261
00:18:54,007 --> 00:18:55,008
Huh?

262
00:18:55,634 --> 00:18:57,052
[Kyo] To the teacher's lounge.

263
00:18:58,220 --> 00:18:59,972
If you couldn't tell, it's pretty heavy.

264
00:19:01,682 --> 00:19:04,350
[Hina] Sure,
but you're not very strong, Kyo.

265
00:19:04,351 --> 00:19:06,102
[Kyo] We don't all work out like you.

266
00:19:06,103 --> 00:19:08,313
- [Hina] Okay, badminton boy.
- [Ayame gasps]

267
00:19:10,315 --> 00:19:12,317
[music fades]

268
00:19:18,073 --> 00:19:19,074
[Taiki grunts]

269
00:19:20,159 --> 00:19:23,161
[Nishida] I love leaving everything
so sparkling and clean!

270
00:19:23,162 --> 00:19:25,079
- I'm hungry...
- [Taiki] Sorry, I gotta go!

271
00:19:25,080 --> 00:19:26,164
Taiki!

272
00:19:26,165 --> 00:19:27,583
[grunting, panting]

273
00:19:30,836 --> 00:19:32,254
<i>I have to talk to her.</i>

274
00:19:32,921 --> 00:19:34,339
[panting]

275
00:19:35,174 --> 00:19:36,842
<i>Tell her I didn't hate it.</i>

276
00:19:38,343 --> 00:19:39,845
<i>That I was happy.</i>

277
00:19:40,429 --> 00:19:44,432
<i>That it was the first time
I've been hugged by the person I like.</i>

278
00:19:44,433 --> 00:19:46,684
[breathing heavily]

279
00:19:46,685 --> 00:19:49,187
[uplifting music playing]

280
00:19:49,188 --> 00:19:50,189
[grunts]

281
00:19:59,615 --> 00:20:01,617
[panting]

282
00:20:06,622 --> 00:20:09,541
[breathing heavily]

283
00:20:13,629 --> 00:20:14,796
[grunts]

284
00:20:19,259 --> 00:20:20,260
[Taiki] Oh!

285
00:20:22,596 --> 00:20:25,265
Oh my. Thank you.

286
00:20:28,602 --> 00:20:29,603
[Taiki grunts]

287
00:20:31,355 --> 00:20:34,775
SHIMURASAKASHITA STATION

288
00:20:35,901 --> 00:20:37,903
[panting accelerates]

289
00:20:42,366 --> 00:20:45,368
[huffing]

290
00:20:45,369 --> 00:20:47,287
[uplifting music continues]

291
00:20:50,749 --> 00:20:52,959
<i>My head is full of that moment.</i>

292
00:20:52,960 --> 00:20:54,503
<i>I have to tell her!</i>

293
00:21:01,385 --> 00:21:02,386
<i>But...</i>

294
00:21:07,266 --> 00:21:08,641
<i>But...</i>

295
00:21:08,642 --> 00:21:10,644
- [music swells]
- [panting]

296
00:21:12,646 --> 00:21:15,565
<i>...I have to tell her in person!</i>

297
00:21:21,446 --> 00:21:22,447
[pants]

298
00:21:23,156 --> 00:21:24,574
- [door opens]
- [music stops]

299
00:21:25,325 --> 00:21:26,326
Hi, I'm home!

300
00:21:26,910 --> 00:21:29,912
What's wrong, Taiki?
Why are you in such a hurry?

301
00:21:29,913 --> 00:21:31,664
Where's Chinatsu?

302
00:21:31,665 --> 00:21:32,833
[Yukiko] She left already.

303
00:21:33,709 --> 00:21:34,917
Uh...

304
00:21:34,918 --> 00:21:38,212
It seems her parents' flight got moved up.

305
00:21:38,213 --> 00:21:40,424
Your dad just drove her over.

306
00:21:41,258 --> 00:21:42,508
[sighs heavily]

307
00:21:42,509 --> 00:21:43,759
[groans]

308
00:21:43,760 --> 00:21:46,346
Why did this happen?

309
00:21:52,019 --> 00:21:54,688
<i>Why does this always...</i>

310
00:22:00,527 --> 00:22:02,529
[engine humming]

311
00:22:18,712 --> 00:22:20,714
[plane whirring in distance]

312
00:22:25,177 --> 00:22:27,179
[closing theme music playing]

